{"id":"wb-7-1702","name":"刘氏兄弟故居","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"刘氏兄弟故居","text":"刘氏兄弟故居位于中国江苏省江阴市西横街49号，坐西朝东，前后二进十间三庭院，是刘半农、刘天华、刘北茂三兄弟的故居，同时也是刘氏兄弟纪念馆。毗邻江阴文庙。2002年被列为江苏省文物保护单位。\n故居内设有六个展室：第一展室为刘半农展室，第二展室为刘天华展室，第三展室是刘半农卧室，第四展室是刘天华卧室，第五展室为厨房，第六展室是刘北茂事迹及各地人士对刘氏兄弟纪念的介绍。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%88%98%E6%B0%8F%E5%85%84%E5%BC%9F%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85","revisionId":86766488,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86766488","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/bc109f8ee1c6994caf681183.jpg","title":"Liu_brothers'_former_home.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Liu_brothers%27_former_home.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/55/Liu_brothers%27_former_home.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Doctoroftcm","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​江阴市刘氏兄弟故居，江苏省文物保护单位","width":320,"height":213}}